  <item>
    <title>10.自嬷 | 人一旦迷醉于自身的软弱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6919de466018cc2c9819e9c5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6919de466018cc2c9819e9c5</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 16 Nov 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期！今夜万万岁的客厅里迎来了新朋友，小徐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为infp</span><em><span> </span></em><span>的小徐，曾经饱受“小蝴蝶”刻板印象之苦，所以在最新一期的节目里，小徐和加菲就“自嬷”这个事情聊开了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从</span><strong><span>自我动物塑</span></strong><span>出发，今天是</span><strong><span>当猫当狗还是做老鼠</span></strong><span>；</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>回看古早台偶娇妻文学</span></strong><span>，那些傻白甜女主和霸道总裁莫名其妙的爱恨纠葛；</span></p><span></span><p><span>也自问深夜emo时的自己，</span><strong><span>对自己的无限怜爱从何而起；</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>或为晚晚叹息，怪她只是沉溺于被欣赏的角色而忘记自己的那些被搁置的才华。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们大胆剖析了这些行为背后，那个</span><strong><span>渴望被看见又不愿直面问题的自己</span></strong><span>。也许适度的自我调侃是幽默，但过度沉溺于“自嬷”，可能就成了</span><strong><span>用温柔包裹的自我放逐</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>来到客厅的朋友们，准备好和我们一起“戒嬷”了吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>直到笑着戳破那些我们给自己制造的泡沫，才能拥抱真实的生活！</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>片头：妇女新知 2021——莫文蔚</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>片尾：Kitty Kat——Megan Three Stallion</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>Timeline:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="34">00:34</a> &nbsp;哈喽大家好！我是客厅的新朋友小徐！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="333">05:33</a> 自嬷？是何意味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> MBTI公嬷讨论之蝶公你崛起吧…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>“帮我看下女朋友”：人是不是会在炫耀和自嬷的过程中再次找到被宠爱的感觉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 娇妻文学经典著作之“男人与妙控键盘“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 在感情中顾影自怜：一边哭泣一边欣赏自己哭泣的姿态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2765">46:05</a> 何必问鬼求药方，先求茁壮先求强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a> "命运馈赠的礼物，早已在暗中标好了价格”: 可是晚晚，缪斯是不能作为一种职业的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3725">01:02:05</a> "狮虎斗"：过度地自我强化和过度的自我矮化也许出于同一种心理</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/678903d13b6a4a5081e61eb5/ltTS7xvr8t88Cqy8J7n-I6u3Duga.m4a" length="71994306" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:11</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2jLxUEDwyd6b0DV61zQnPWePYC.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>10</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>09.上岸失败，我堵在人生的独库公路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6864be7060f8f77d406af527</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6864be7060f8f77d406af527</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 02 Jul 2025 08:54:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于通过了毕业答辩的乔恩，去新疆旅行了。天山天池有多美，独库公路就有多堵。前不着村后不着店的荒野上，乔恩意识到</span><strong><span>人生中很多时刻也犹如堵车一般，充满灰色、犹疑、和悬而未决：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>朋友和讨厌的人玩</span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span>绝交</span></strong><span>显得小题大做，</span><strong><span>忍耐</span></strong><span>又憋得乳腺增生；</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>老友与我渐行渐远</span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span>挽留</span></strong><span>显得刻舟求剑，</span><strong><span>放手</span></strong><span>又不甘不愿；</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>跟暧昧对象接吻了</span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span>推进关系</span></strong><span>好像操之过急，</span><strong><span>含糊其辞</span></strong><span>倒成了我的道德瑕疵；</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>老板讲了地狱笑话</span></strong><span>，</span><strong><span>不笑</span></strong><span>扣工资，</span><strong><span>笑了</span></strong><span>又扣功德；</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>考研/留学/秋招上岸失败</span></strong><span>，未来悬而未决，再怎么努力也暂时无法进入下一个人生阶段，回看象牙塔，也已经成了别人象牙塔。</span></p><span></span><p><span>……</span></p><span></span><p><span>乔恩女士，</span><strong><span>堵在了新疆。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>加菲小姐，</span><strong><span>堵在了人生的岔路口上。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>但方向盘还在手里，</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>开过这段，</span><strong><span>就把油门踩到底。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>片头片尾：漂流人间——Chinese Football</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Timeline:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">00:02:06</a>:乔恩女士，在独库公路堵出哲思——人生充满灰色！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">00:06:21</a>:可以接受朋友跟讨厌的人玩吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="633">00:10:33</a>:不喜欢朋友的伴侣，还能维持表面的友好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="727">00:12:07</a>:如果无法伤害到对方，分手后要愤怒报复吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">00:20:31</a>:可以接受与朋友渐行渐远吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">00:30:23</a>:别扭的人与赶不走的伴侣：“求来的关注我就不要了！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">00:36:38</a>:接吻≠确定关系，不挑明就无事发生？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2630">00:43:50</a>:没有确定关系前，可以同时发展好几段暧昧关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3590">00:59:50</a>:在不同场合会根据当下的言论方向调整自己的观点，即使言不由衷？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3251">00:54:11</a>:即使不认可某种游戏规则，也会为了赢而遵守？比如自媒体标题党？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3654">01:00:54</a>:秋招失败：主线暂时推不动，就原地打打残章吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4190">01:09:50</a>:不用克服消极情绪，因果成熟会自动脱离。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/678903d13b6a4a5081e61eb5/lhWZlAeCd8vRrSpxLpB_CNxy5htR.m4a" length="81463580" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:23:57</itunes:duration>
