  <item>
    <title>05.我疯狂利用碎片时间，只是在假装能控制人生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cdc2e8e924d4525a690383</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cdc2e8e924d4525a690383</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 10 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>听播客记笔记、看美剧关字幕、通勤倍速看新闻……成长过程中一直被表扬自律的加菲终于在人生的第22年迎来了效率总崩溃。残酷的秋招让她对效率的极致追求愈演愈烈，享乐羞耻、抗拒无聊、Burn Out、连绕路看小猫都变成了低效行为。她爬向乔恩医生的会诊室，试图寻找一劳永逸的解法</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>病情概览</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> “我每一秒都把控ROI。”听播客一定要学东西、看美剧一定要学英语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> “无聊令我无所适从。这段时间居然不能学点什么？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> Burn Out来袭：“排球向我飞来的时刻，我在想打排球的意义是什么。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="823">13:43</a> “极致的效率抹杀了我的灵感、偶遇、甚至梦境。”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>病因分析</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> “意义是未来价值的折现，而我爱的就是你当下这个瞬间。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> “我要不断成长，因为优秀才会被爱。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> “如果你觉得我是因为优秀才爱你，那你把我的爱也看轻了。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">28:52</a> “卷是我面对不确定性的安抚剂。“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1848">30:48</a> “你对优秀的定义太过暴力。”《倦怠社会》与积极化世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a> “可增长不正是这个世界运行的底层逻辑吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>开了药，但是没开</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">39:49</a> 散步是不可或缺的“生态性”行为，项彪说的。（项彪没说）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2704">45:04</a> “不会有人来看我的画，但画画很开心。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2909">48:29</a> “你先别急。”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片头片尾</span></strong><span> 《缸》草东没有派对，《逍遥一客》翠花不太脆</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>听友群 </span></strong><span>感谢大家收听，欢迎各位听友/厅友来到客厅坐坐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhH_GvShMvhdcB3tBP0J4bBRbPQc.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/678903d13b6a4a5081e61eb5/lhRq_vp30ENtQE1osyK0b4F6qWiN.m4a" length="51753413" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:53:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2jLxUEDwyd6b0DV61zQnPWePYC.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>5</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>04.青春的最后一页，留给彩云之南（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67acc1b85e6f58876df6e96f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67acc1b85e6f58876df6e96f</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Feb 2025 15:49:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在上一回中加菲和乔恩在回忆里重温了白沙草堂的篝火、玉龙雪山的牦牛群和蓝月谷的碧蓝湖水，在接下里的旅途中，我们对唱、捡司机、追晚霞、聊大天，又邂逅了不少奇遇，这就是p人旅行的魅力时刻，这就是和朋友出游的奇幻魔法！</span></p><span></span><p><span>关键词：云南/毕业旅行/自驾</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小姚：“依旧是不知道为什么出现但就是坐在这里了的小姚”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 束河古镇偶遇迪克牛仔，怀旧歌会走起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 以歌会友，四人行变五人行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 雨天大雾山路海龟汤，牛群红土路边棺材</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="770">12:50</a> 绕洱海开车追晚霞“你是不是在云的脚下，在等雨落下，是不是在列车尾端告别晚霞”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 最后一夜，点亮烟花在瓶中绽放，祝我们前路坦荡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 那些不可复刻的可惜夜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a> “带我去找夜生活”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1879">31:19</a> “旅行最重要的是什么？”“人！朋友！陪伴！”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrUGcrbOYcZAzZkZ_GOh--PTWbmy.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmV1Sg6IzyaQalnFx6fFh5OmolYv.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoL05wOWoJdg6-farLlsUG5Ij1Ve.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/678903d13b6a4a5081e61eb5/llws8LBucrzxm02hVegnQP54vYYF.m4a" length="37639445" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo9IzJYFxtW-L5WcQW3CukJMHU8l.png"/>
