  <item>
    <title>03.青春的最后一页，留给彩云之南（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/679ee2ddd74435e4a3b75ccd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">679ee2ddd74435e4a3b75ccd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Feb 2025 03:24:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>研究生都快毕业的两位主播突然回忆起本科毕业的云南之旅。这是一次奇遇不断笑料满满的典型P人旅行，我们化缘、撸狗、对山歌、跳舞、捡司机、追晚霞，并在这次旅行的最后一天拍下了本播客的封面。</span></p><span></span><p><span>关键词：云南/毕业旅行/自驾</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：小姚：“我也不知道为什么这期需要嘉宾。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 我们上新星榜了！感恩听友！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 出发前夜，乔恩宿舍惊现黑影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="397">06:37</a> “即使老公出轨我也可以原谅你”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="648">10:48</a> 4P人不负众望！压last call登机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 丽江：古宅民宿包场、深夜化缘挂面、《自家酿的度数不高》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1220">20:20</a> 白沙：十五年前的丽江、大狗天堂与文青集散地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1722">28:42</a> 白沙：篝火之夜，“丽江没有以后”“肉肉是性感的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">42:42</a> 玉龙雪山：神山圣湖下，出不出片的已经不重要了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnK8kHnI-dWhvWKcgIoPHfuHbbYH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuGqR2kana4hukNblvpmow1GXB5L.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm9AHnVYiaQVjkeiA1raZxCfA-sw.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg_SJvuXtblBYHvMmgmAEXg7Xnka.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqk4BzIpZRRNn5EAdLjryLE4Wmka.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/678903d13b6a4a5081e61eb5/lu4WVpzKbxtWFxxVFmRW-V3_UjWK.m4a" length="53039167" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:39</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtP7efCdNLhsl1o29YAvBbaTFMQy.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>3</itunes:episode>
